    [module name=fp gate=enforced reason='full §1 impl complete + spec-faithful (ENFORCED, all 15 cases green): the six-combinator protocol map/flat-map/pure/traverse/sequence/fold dispatching on the head tag (sequence=Maybe+List, result=[ok]/[err]), E_NO_INSTANCE=cx-err:CXER4400 (D001) on an un-instanced tagged element; combinators are native fp-* prims (vcx/code/stdlib_fp.v) reached via the HOF env path since they apply a CX callable. Fixtures corrected: bracketed [$fn] callable args → bare $fn first-class refs (the established convention; [$fn] is a zero-arg call), and colon-bearing err code attrs quoted code=\'cx-err:CXER9999\' to parse (render emits bareword) — Stage-B authoring defects, D0xx C4']
